  "static_checks": "Full Starmap checks gate, goago, consumer pinned lint and vet, module verification, final tidy diff, architecture, and changed prose checks pass.",
  "contract": [
    "The private-file owner parses canonical bounded native journals without using their historical native identities as restore authority. Native cleanup retains all current identity checks.",
    "The runtime owner allows only its five publication scopes and known destination/prefix pairs. Captured staging bytes must match the recorded size and digest; writer metadata must be present and empty.",
    "Starport retains approved journals and staging bytes in the verified backup and inactive preparation, reports verified-staging, and never promotes a staged candidate.",
    "Canonical destination records remain selected and require normal inventory and owner validation. Exact retries preserve the same selection.",
    "Malformed or unowned journals, changed staging bytes, and incomplete migration history refuse. A mismatch stops before target stores are created. All admission barriers remain closed."
  ],
